    "name": "Tattoo Removal Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 3143910,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/extras/32eea024f8e167b802457912641e3899.poster.avif?t=1755252939\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/extras/32eea024f8e167b802457912641e3899.webm?t=1755252939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/extras/32eea024f8e167b802457912641e3899.mp4?t=1755252939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Tattoo Removal Simulator, you take on the role of a skilled tattoo removal specialist. Set in a small studio in a bustling city, your all clients share one goal: erasing parts of their past, marked by colorful images, texts, secrets, and stories. From light-hearted humor and dark jokes to life experiences filled with drama, love, and joy, each tattoo tells a unique tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/extras/63931fc03e7f30bcbde7d6d8bbb95060.poster.avif?t=1755252939\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/extras/63931fc03e7f30bcbde7d6d8bbb95060.webm?t=1755252939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/extras/63931fc03e7f30bcbde7d6d8bbb95060.mp4?t=1755252939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the satisfaction of revealing clean skin as you erase intricate tattoos and uncover the personal tales behind them. Enjoy a soothing pace that lets you focus on the calming process of tattoo removal. Be mindful of the pain you cause - too much discomfort, and you could lose earnings!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/extras/ab805981345530a13e34c25dd09197b3.poster.avif?t=1755252939\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/extras/ab805981345530a13e34c25dd09197b3.webm?t=1755252939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/extras/ab805981345530a13e34c25dd09197b3.mp4?t=1755252939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME MODES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Career Mode</strong> - Build and manage your tattoo removal studio. Use your tablet to find clients and track their stories. Earn money by delivering high-quality work; mistakes lead to penalties and unhappy customers. Upgrade your studio, purchase new equipment and unlock advanced tools, from simple lasers to futuristic plasma lasers, and grow your business.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Casual Mode </strong>- Jump into a casual, relaxing experience. Random clients and fun tattoo removal sessions await you. No pressure, no penalties, just enjoy the process of cleaning away ink.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Story Mode</strong> - Experience unique and unpredictable stories right in your studio. Some may take you to a fascinating locations, while others may be interrupted by unexpected events. Immerse yourself and find out how these stories unfold!<br>  <br>In the world where every tattoo tells a story, and every removal brings a sense of peace and satisfaction - discover the art of tattoo removal in a game that\u2019s all about relaxation, storytelling, and transformation.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VR SUPPORTED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your immersion to the next level and experience the game with full VR support, adding a new dimension that makes each moment even more thrilling and memorable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/extras/363d03234dd32951f3b5e155bfdba8fe.poster.avif?t=1755252939\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/extras/363d03234dd32951f3b5e155bfdba8fe.webm?t=1755252939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/extras/363d03234dd32951f3b5e155bfdba8fe.mp4?t=1755252939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/extras/32eea024f8e167b802457912641e3899.poster.avif?t=1755252939\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/extras/32eea024f8e167b802457912641e3899.webm?t=1755252939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/extras/32eea024f8e167b802457912641e3899.mp4?t=1755252939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Tattoo Removal Simulator, you take on the role of a skilled tattoo removal specialist. Set in a small studio in a bustling city, your all clients share one goal: erasing parts of their past, marked by colorful images, texts, secrets, and stories. From light-hearted humor and dark jokes to life experiences filled with drama, love, and joy, each tattoo tells a unique tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/extras/63931fc03e7f30bcbde7d6d8bbb95060.poster.avif?t=1755252939\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/extras/63931fc03e7f30bcbde7d6d8bbb95060.webm?t=1755252939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/extras/63931fc03e7f30bcbde7d6d8bbb95060.mp4?t=1755252939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the satisfaction of revealing clean skin as you erase intricate tattoos and uncover the personal tales behind them. Enjoy a soothing pace that lets you focus on the calming process of tattoo removal. Be mindful of the pain you cause - too much discomfort, and you could lose earnings!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/extras/ab805981345530a13e34c25dd09197b3.poster.avif?t=1755252939\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/extras/ab805981345530a13e34c25dd09197b3.webm?t=1755252939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/extras/ab805981345530a13e34c25dd09197b3.mp4?t=1755252939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME MODES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Career Mode</strong> - Build and manage your tattoo removal studio. Use your tablet to find clients and track their stories. Earn money by delivering high-quality work; mistakes lead to penalties and unhappy customers. Upgrade your studio, purchase new equipment and unlock advanced tools, from simple lasers to futuristic plasma lasers, and grow your business.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Casual Mode </strong>- Jump into a casual, relaxing experience. Random clients and fun tattoo removal sessions await you. No pressure, no penalties, just enjoy the process of cleaning away ink.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Story Mode</strong> - Experience unique and unpredictable stories right in your studio. Some may take you to a fascinating locations, while others may be interrupted by unexpected events. Immerse yourself and find out how these stories unfold!<br>  <br>In the world where every tattoo tells a story, and every removal brings a sense of peace and satisfaction - discover the art of tattoo removal in a game that\u2019s all about relaxation, storytelling, and transformation.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VR SUPPORTED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your immersion to the next level and experience the game with full VR support, adding a new dimension that makes each moment even more thrilling and memorable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/extras/363d03234dd32951f3b5e155bfdba8fe.poster.avif?t=1755252939\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/extras/363d03234dd32951f3b5e155bfdba8fe.webm?t=1755252939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/extras/363d03234dd32951f3b5e155bfdba8fe.mp4?t=1755252939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
